#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275579 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ddfe5f91-ee8a-5252-8be6-2a9828a470cf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186275581} {:answer/id #uuid "a7f3f431-4a20-536f-9053-222bd1fc38a2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186275582}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a7f3f431-4a20-536f-9053-222bd1fc38a2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186275582} :answer-field/id #uuid "e8b93417-6775-5f38-8566-f0306993f132" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186275580}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "168c0e01-fa73-5720-9d05-467e30424e24" :question/math-academy-id "q-320394" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972686/assets/f63cf622acc15681e3815118bbd2a187ea6039a548d4be1773634c0dc450c343.png)\n\nDetermine the area $A$ of the parallelogram in the figure.\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨4,-1⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨-2,-3⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4\\cdot (-3)-(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-12-2 \\\\  & =-14\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-14|=14\n$$"}]}
